---
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Terms of Service — Penida-Go" description="Terms and conditions for Penida-Go transportation services.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none space-y-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <p>Welcome to Penida-Go. By booking our private transfer or tour services, you agree to the following terms and conditions.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">1. Booking and Confirmation</h2>
      <p>Bookings are officially confirmed once trip details and schedule have been acknowledged by our customer service team via WhatsApp.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">2. Punctuality and Waiting Time</h2>
      <p>Drivers will arrive at the agreed pickup point at the designated time. Standard airport pickup includes 60 minutes free waiting time after flight touchdown.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-6 mb-2">3. Payment Terms</h2>
      <p>Payment can be made in cash (IDR), bank transfer, or QRIS upon arrival as agreed during WhatsApp consultation.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
